# i95: one launcher for every GTA VI (GTA 6) Xbox Series runtime on PC

![i95: GTA 6 Xbox Series launcher for Windows PC](assets/banner.svg)

Try them all from one window.

i95 is a Windows app that runs the projects trying to bring the Xbox Series version of GTA VI to PC. You pick one, press Play, and i95 builds it, prepares the shaders and starts the game. It uses a copy of the game you dumped from your own console. No game files are included.

**None of these runtimes is playable yet.** The tracker's bar for playable is 20 fps and 30 minutes without a crash, and nobody has cleared it.

## Standings

Ranks come from vuyp's [GTA VI PC race tracker](https://vuyp.github.io/gta6-pc-race/) ([repo](https://github.com/vuyp/gta6-pc-race)). i95 has 22 runtimes, and the launcher lists them in one list in that order.

"Its author reports" is what each project says about itself, in its own words where we could. "Here" is our own PC: i5-14400F, RTX 4060 8 GB, 16 GB RAM, Windows 11. Most authors test on faster cards, so expect less on yours if it's like ours.

| Rank | Runtime | Based on | Its author reports | Here |
|---:|---|---|---|---|
