| 2 | [AnyXboxX](https://github.com/LooperSalty/AnyXboxX) | VIctory (Neptune) | "~14 fps in the world" on an RTX 4070 SUPER, 14 to 17 fps over the last minute | ✅ 10 min, no crash, ~14 fps (earlier build). Try this one first on NVIDIA |
| 3 | [Kelvaroq](https://github.com/fablinoo/kelvaroq) | VIctory, victory-fork | ~10 fps in typical views on an RTX 5080; a tester's 36 min session without a crash | Testing |
